# keep the build context small and free of host secrets. the Dockerfile only COPYs
# skills/, opencode/skills/, hmux/config.toml, workspace/, and docker-entrypoint.sh;
# everything below is either irrelevant to the image or host-specific/secret.
.git
.gitignore
.pytest_cache
**/__pycache__
# secrets + host-specific provider config (also gitignored); never bake into the image.
persona.env
models.json
# host-side tooling: rewrites the host's persona.env and shells out to the hmux checkout beside
# persona, neither of which exists in the image. everything under skills/ IS shipped.
scripts
# not needed at build time.
evals
*.md
LICENSE
.claude
